## 24. Metrics
Target example (set after baseline): citation precision ≥90%, jurisdiction leak 0 on test set, abstain correctly ≥85% on unanswerable, classifier accuracy on 30 case vignettes.

## 25. MVP
Corpus: Patents Act + 2024 Rules (§3(p), §3(d), §3(e)), BD Act 2023 + 2024 Rules, D&C Act ASU provisions, Drugs & Magic Remedies Act, TRIPS 27.3(b), Nagoya, WIPO GRATK, PCT basics. ~20-30 docs, well chunked. Plus classifier, two lanes, verifier, 3 languages (English, Hindi, Gujarati), eval dashboard.

## 26. Future
Knowledge graph (statute ↔ form ↔ authority), paid-source connectors with logged consent, voice, export-market herbal regimes, human facilitator inbox.

## 27. Verdict
### 🟡 BUILD WITH CHANGES
Build it, but do not compete on feature count. Cut graph, agents, fake TKDL search. Win on: verified citations, honest abstention, published eval numbers, clean lane separation, domain-expert-checked corpus. Demo story: same tricky question to plain LLM (wrong section, mixed jurisdiction) vs yours (correct, cited, abstains on missing facts).

**Open unknowns (risk):** team size/time left? Bhashini access confirmed? Domain reviewer available? If no reviewer, accuracy claims weak; get one.